    "上下文窗口 = 模型单次请求能处理的最大 token 数。输入 + 输出共享此上限。接近上限时可能导致截断或错误。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Context window = the maximum number of tokens a model can process in one request. Input + output share this limit. Approaching it may cause truncation or errors."
          }
        },
